#. type: dialogue
#. speaker: Sotaro Komaki
#. speaker-source: meta_0209_explicit
#. line-id: 65_0_5
#. en-match: 1:1 (EN:ES)
#. en-confidence: high
#. english: You have the capacity to be the strongest||man in the world, {PA:10}with the proper training. [line-id 65_0_5]
#. jp-match: 1:1 (JP:ES via EN)
#. jp-confidence: high
#. jp-via-english: 1/1
